  "sourceTitle": "\"Fruit Salad\" Salad Smoothie",
  "sourceText": "\"Fruit Salad\" Salad Smoothie\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 24, 2009 - 11:14pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 medium Ripe peach\n3/4 cup Fresh OR frozen strawberries\n1/2 Banana, peeled\n2 cups Skimmed evaporated milk, chilled\n4 teaspoons Frozen orange jc concentrate\n1 teaspoon Vanilla\n4 -6 ice cubes\nCinnamon, optional\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine everything in blender except ice and cinnamon. With blender running, add ice cubes one at a time. Divide Smoothie into 4 chilled glasses and sprinkle with cinnamon.",
